{"3444650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mosaic of the Strange", "steam_appid": 3444650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve huge logic-based puzzles to unlock 144 real-world paranormal files, whilst building a case to help FBI Special Agents Cullen and Brady investigate a bizarre murder. Discover a fascinating range of Cryptids, Alien Encounters, Unsolved Murders, Conspiracies, Psychic Phenomena, Hauntings, Possessions and much more!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444650/extras/bb8e27c3a992109df85197ecfeebf5fb.poster.avif?t=1769871130\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444650/extras/bb8e27c3a992109df85197ecfeebf5fb.webm?t=1769871130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444650/extras/bb8e27c3a992109df85197ecfeebf5fb.mp4?t=1769871130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Mosaic of the Strange combines story-driven point &amp; click elements with addictive mosaic logic puzzles! Progress through enormous interlocking minesweeper-like puzzles while you attempt to solve a grisly supernatural murder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖼️ Every completed region reveals case file details based on real-world paranormal events, strange creatures, unsolved murders, and mysterious deaths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📖 Mosaic of the Strange takes storytelling much further than previous games in the series, as engaging characters and dialogue draw you further into a compelling murder mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💣 If you know how to play Minesweeper, you already know how to play a Mosaic game! The numbered clues (0-9) indicate how many light tiles must be placed within 1 square of the clue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎶 Featuring an original soundtrack inspired by classic 90s crime thrillers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏳ Dozens of Hours of Addictive Gameplay: Lose yourself in hours of bewitching puzzle-solving as you explore the world of the paranormal._</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444650/extras/a278d23c9af3e591a95c1fc2601dd60e.poster.avif?t=1769871130\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444650/extras/a278d23c9af3e591a95c1fc2601dd60e.webm?t=1769871130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444650/extras/a278d23c9af3e591a95c1fc2601dd60e.mp4?t=1769871130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve huge logic-based puzzles to unlock 144 real-world paranormal files, whilst building a case to help FBI Special Agents Cullen and Brady investigate a bizarre murder. Discover a fascinating range of Cryptids, Alien Encounters, Unsolved Murders, Conspiracies, Psychic Phenomena, Hauntings, Possessions and much more!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444650/extras/bb8e27c3a992109df85197ecfeebf5fb.poster.avif?t=1769871130\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444650/extras/bb8e27c3a992109df85197ecfeebf5fb.webm?t=1769871130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444650/extras/bb8e27c3a992109df85197ecfeebf5fb.mp4?t=1769871130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Mosaic of the Strange combines story-driven point &amp; click elements with addictive mosaic logic puzzles! Progress through enormous interlocking minesweeper-like puzzles while you attempt to solve a grisly supernatural murder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖼️ Every completed region reveals case file details based on real-world paranormal events, strange creatures, unsolved murders, and mysterious deaths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📖 Mosaic of the Strange takes storytelling much further than previous games in the series, as engaging characters and dialogue draw you further into a compelling murder mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💣 If you know how to play Minesweeper, you already know how to play a Mosaic game! The numbered clues (0-9) indicate how many light tiles must be placed within 1 square of the clue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎶 Featuring an original soundtrack inspired by classic 90s crime thrillers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏳ Dozens of Hours of Addictive Gameplay: Lose yourself in hours of bewitching puzzle-solving as you explore the world of the paranormal._</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444650/extras/a278d23c9af3e591a95c1fc2601dd60e.poster.avif?t=1769871130\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as